- Purchase button.
- Optional rarity classification.

Use a consistent rarity system only if it has meaningful benefits for progression or collecting.

Ensure that every purchase updates the actual currency balance, inventory, and relevant appearance or base systems.

### Player listings

Preserve or improve the ability to list eligible owned items for sale.

When listing an item:
- Display the current item and its details.
- Require an asking price.
- Verify that the item is owned and eligible for sale.
- Prevent duplicate listings of the same non-duplicable item.
- Remove the item from available inventory or clearly mark it as listed.
- Support cancellation according to clear rules.
- Restore the item to inventory when the listing is cancelled.

### Auction house

